meta {
  name: Correct product (PENDING_REVIEW reset)
  type: http
  seq: 7
}

patch {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/products/{{productId}}
  body: json
  auth: bearer
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{accessToken}}
}

body:json {
  {
    "name": "Corrected Product Name",
    "brand": "BrandCo",
    "genericName": null,
    "energyKcal": 250,
    "fat": 3.5,
    "saturatedFat": 1.2,
    "carbohydrates": 45,
    "sugars": 5,
    "protein": 8,
    "salt": 1.2,
    "servingSize": "50g",
    "ingredients": "Flour, water, salt, yeast"
  }
}

docs {
  TICKET-P5-006 (re-keyed in TICKET-P6-009) — In-place correction of a PENDING_REVIEW submission.
  Registered users only. `:productId` must be a UUID (400 { code: 'invalid_product_id' } otherwise).

  Accepts a FULL product payload (the id comes from the URL, not the body). On success the Product
  fields (name, brand) and — for a PACKAGED product — the PackagedProduct fields (nutrition,
  ingredients) are replaced in one transaction, all existing verification votes are deleted (review
  restarts from zero), and the caller becomes the submitter. `productImageKey` is OPTIONAL — include
  it only when the photo was replaced via POST /upload-image; omitting it keeps the current image.

  Response: the updated product, serialized the same way as Get product by id (nutrition nested
  under `packaged`).

  TICKET-P6-007 — for a CUSTOM product (no barcode, no PackagedProduct row), the server looks up
  the product's `kind` first and expects a DIFFERENT, minimal body shape instead of the full
  packaged payload above: { name?, productImageKey? } — only the name and/or photo, both
  optional (send at least one). Any packaged-only field (brand, genericName, nutrition fields,
  servingSize, ingredients, allergens) in the body for a CUSTOM product is a 400, not silently
  dropped. A rename is checked for a name collision against every other non-REJECTED custom
  product before it is written.

  Errors:
  - 400 — a packaged-only field was sent for a CUSTOM product ({ message })
  - 401 — unauthenticated
  - 403 — anonymous user ({ error: 'Registration required' })
  - 404 — product not found, including REJECTED ({ error: 'product_not_found' })
  - 409 — product is VERIFIED, use the edit-proposal flow ({ error: 'product_verified' }); or
    (CUSTOM only) the new name collides with another custom product
    ({ code: 'duplicate_name', productId, message })
  - 422 — validation failure ({ error, reason, field })
}
